  componentName: Final Position Extend Sensor
  plcName: b1
  plcAddress: 0.06
  description: 'Model                       : D-A93L

    Type                        
    : Reed Type Magnetic Detector

    Mounting                  : On MDUB25-200DMZ
    (extended/end position)

    Output Type             : Digital

    PLC Signal               
    : b1

    PLC Input Address   : 0.06


    Detects when the final position pusher
    cylinder has fully extended, confirming the body has arrived at the assembly
    position and is ready for component assembly.'
